; ACCEPTED: M2 ends the job, lifts the pen and
; resets the modal state
; (G90, no motion word, pen up); in the serial
; variant the next line
; starts a new job. Part 2 begins with a motion
; word, as it must:
; bare coordinates there would be error:26 (see
; 33_Refuse_26).
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
; part 1: a short line with the pen down
G91
M3
G1 X20
M2
; part 2: a new job. $G must now read G0 G90 M5
G1 X10 Y10
G1 X0 Y0
M30
; part 3: M30 does the same
G0 X5 Y5
M30
G0 X0 Y0
